      "plaintextBody": "Folks,\n\nI just received an automated request for Autopay setup (see attached). Yet, I still haven’t invoices for July or June and I don’t see a resolution to this issue. When can we get this cleared up so that your automated processes do no inadvertently turn off our services?\n\nOscar\n\nFrom: Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nDate: Wednesday, August 19, 2026 at 4:20 PM\nTo: Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\nCc: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003cjonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003e; Marilyn Rodriguez \u003cmarilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e; rob.smith@optconnect.com \u003crob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e; lacey.hataway@optconnect.com \u003clacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e; net-eng@optconnect.com \u003cnet-eng@optconnect.com\u003e\nSubject: Re: OptConnect - NovaCharge - Follow up meeting\n\nHi Oscar,\n\nI hope you are having a great week.\n\nFollowing up if you can provide general regions where you operate (not specific addresses).\n\nThank you,\n\nMark Parreno\nAccount Manager\nDirect: (408) 500-8371\nEmail: mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nAddress: 865 W 450 N, Suite 1, Kaysville, UT 84037\nWebsite: www.OptConnect.com\u003chttp://www.optconnect.com/\u003e // www.\u003chttp://www.premierwireless.io/\u003epws.bz\u003chttp://pws.bz\u003e\n [cid:72A45E37F42948668115A97C659131B1]\n\nOn Fri, Jul 31, 2026 at 11:40 AM Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e wrote:\nUnderstood - thank you.\n\nFrom: Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nDate: Friday, July 31, 2026 at 2:25 PM\nTo: Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e\nCc: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:andy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003cjonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:jonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e; Marilyn Rodriguez \u003cmarilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:marilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e; rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e \u003crob.smith@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e \u003clacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; net-eng@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:net-eng@optconnect.com\u003e \u003cnet-eng@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:net-eng@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nSubject: Re: OptConnect - NovaCharge - Follow up meeting\n\nHi Oscar,\n\nWe're assessing the overall situation to best address your needs. We just need general regions where you operate, not specific addresses. Our engineering team is continuing to work the issue.\n\nThank you,\n\nMark Parreno\nAccount Manager\nDirect: (408) 500-8371\nEmail: mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nAddress: 865 W 450 N, Suite 1, Kaysville, UT 84037\u003chttps://www.google.com/maps/search/865+W+450+N,+Suite+1,+Kaysville,+UT%0D%0A+84037?entry=gmail&source=g\u003e\nWebsite: www.OptConnect.com\u003chttp://www.optconnect.com/\u003e // www.\u003chttp://www.premierwireless.io/\u003epws.bz\u003chttp://pws.bz\u003e\n [5FC50A2F-5840-45C0-8EB1-F084954DDC6B]\n\nOn Fri, Jul 31, 2026 at 10:25 AM Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e wrote:\nHmmm - a bit surprised on the location request, unless we think this is coverage issue or a tower/base station issue? Can you clarify?\n\nOscar\n\nFrom: Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nDate: Friday, July 31, 2026 at 1:19 PM\nTo: Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e\nCc: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:andy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003cjonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:jonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e; Marilyn Rodriguez \u003cmarilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:marilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e; rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e \u003crob.smith@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e \u003clacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; net-eng@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:net-eng@optconnect.com\u003e \u003cnet-eng@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:net-eng@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nSubject: Re: OptConnect - NovaCharge - Follow up meeting\n\nHi Oscar and Jonathan,\n\nCan you also provide the specific addresses/locations where these devices are located? We want to ensure our suggestions for potential new plans suit your needs.\n\nThank you,\n\nMark Parreno\nAccount Manager\nDirect: (408) 500-8371\nEmail: mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nAddress: 865 W 450 N, Suite 1, Kaysville, UT 84037\u003chttps://www.google.com/maps/search/865+W+450+N,+Suite+1,+Kaysville,+UT%0D%0A+84037?entry=gmail&source=g\u003e\nWebsite: www.OptConnect.com\u003chttp://www.optconnect.com/\u003e // www.\u003chttp://www.premierwireless.io/\u003epws.bz\u003chttp://pws.bz\u003e\n [cid:ii_1a01bac6bd3afff71d51]\n\nOn Thu, Jul 30, 2026 at 8:55 AM Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e wrote:\nThank you for your note, Andy.\n\nJonathan - can you please provide the information requested here for the sample ATT SIM? Thank you.\n\nOscar\n\nFrom: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:andy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nDate: Thursday, July 30, 2026 at 11:38 AM\nTo: Jonathan G