      "plaintextBody": "Hi Oscar,\n\nDo you have time today for a quick call?\n\nThank you,\n\n*Mark Parreno*\n\n*Account Manager*\n\n*Direct*: (408) 500-8371\n\n*Email:* mark.parreno@optconnect.com\n\n*Address:* 865 W 450 N, Suite 1, Kaysville, UT 84037\n\n*Website:* www.OptConnect.com \u003chttp://www.optconnect.com/\u003e // *www.\n\u003chttp://www.premierwireless.io/\u003epws.bz \u003chttp://pws.bz\u003e*\n\nOn Tue, Aug 25, 2026 at 7:53 AM Oscar Rodriguez \u003c\noscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e wrote:\n\n\u003e Folks,\n\u003e\n\u003e I just received an automated request for Autopay setup (see attached).\n\u003e Yet, I still haven’t invoices for July or June and I don’t see a resolution\n\u003e to this issue. When can we get this cleared up so that your automated\n\u003e processes do no inadvertently turn off our services?\n\u003e\n\u003e Oscar\n\u003e\n\u003e *From: *Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\n\u003e *Date: *Wednesday, August 19, 2026 at 4:20 PM\n\u003e *To: *Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\n\u003e *Cc: *Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003c\n\u003e jonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003e; Marilyn Rodriguez \u003c\n\u003e marilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e; rob.smith@optconnect.com \u003c\n\u003e rob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e; lacey.hataway@optconnect.com \u003c\n\u003e lacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e; net-eng@optconnect.com \u003c\n\u003e net-eng@optconnect.com\u003e\n\u003e *Subject: *Re: OptConnect - NovaCharge - Follow up meeting\n\u003e\n\u003e Hi Oscar,\n\u003e\n\u003e\n\u003e I hope you are having a great week.\n\u003e\n\u003e Following up if you can provide general regions where you operate (not\n\u003e specific addresses).\n\u003e\n\u003e Thank you,\n\u003e\n\u003e *Mark Parreno*\n\u003e\n\u003e *Account Manager*\n\u003e\n\u003e *Direct*: (408) 500-8371\n\u003e\n\u003e *Email:* mark.parreno@optconnect.com\n\u003e\n\u003e *Address:* 865 W 450 N, Suite 1