      "plaintextBody": "Yes - I’m open starting at 2Pm EDT.\n\nFrom: Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nDate: Tuesday, August 25, 2026 at 12:49 PM\nTo: Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\nCc: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003cjonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003e; Marilyn Rodriguez \u003cmarilynrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e; rob.smith@optconnect.com \u003crob.smith@optconnect.com\u003e; lacey.hataway@optconnect.com \u003clacey.hataway@optconnect.com\u003e; net-eng@optconnect.com \u003cnet-eng@optconnect.com\u003e\nSubject: Re: URGENT - Re: OptConnect - NovaCharge - Follow up meeting\n\nHi Oscar,\n\nDo you have time today for a quick call?\n\nThank you,\n\nMark Parreno\nAccount Manager\nDirect: (408) 500-8371\nEmail: mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\nAddress: 865 W 450 N, Suite 1, Kaysville, UT 84037\nWebsite: www.OptConnect.com\u003chttp://www.optconnect.com/\u003e // www.\u003chttp://www.premierwireless.io/\u003epws.bz\u003chttp://pws.bz\u003e\n [cid:72A45E37F42948668115A97C659131B1]\n\nOn Tue, Aug 25, 2026 at 7:53 AM Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e wrote:\nFolks,\n\nI just received an automated request for Autopay setup (see attached). Yet, I still haven’t invoices for July or June and I don’t see a resolution to this issue. When can we get this cleared up so that your automated processes do no inadvertently turn off our services?\n\nOscar\n\nFrom: Mark Parreno \u003cmark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:mark.parreno@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e\nDate: Wednesday, August 19, 2026 at 4:20 PM\nTo: Oscar Rodriguez \u003coscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003cmailto:oscarrodriguez@novacharge.net\u003e\u003e\nCc: Andy Cutright \u003candy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003cmailto:andy.cutright@optconnect.com\u003e\u003e; Jonathan Gilbert \u003cjonathangilbert@novacharge.net\u003cmai